::warning file=domain/entities.go,line=34,col=2,title=W015 timestamp without time zone::public.things.naive is timestamp without time zone%0A%0Athe column stores a wall clock reading with no offset, so the instant it denotes depends on whoever reads it%0A%0AFix: change the column to timestamptz, or set strict.timestamp_without_tz: off if the ambiguity is intended
::error file=domain/entities.go,line=37,col=2,title=E013 type has no configured Go mapping::public.things.amount has no configured Go mapping for numeric%0A%0Athere is no lossless built-in Go type for an arbitrary-precision decimal, and mapping it to float64 would silently corrupt money%0A%0AFix: add a types.numeric entry to orm.yaml:%0Atypes:%0A  numeric:%0A    go: github.com/shopspring/decimal.Decimal%0A    codec: decimal
::error file=domain/entities.go,line=38,col=2,title=E013 type has no configured Go mapping::public.things.ref has no configured Go mapping for uuid%0A%0AGo has no uuid type, and the popular third-party ones are not interchangeable%0A%0AFix: add a types.uuid entry to orm.yaml:%0Atypes:%0A  uuid:%0A    go: github.com/google/uuid.UUID%0A    codec: uuid
::error file=domain/entities.go,line=40,col=2,title=E006 incompatible Go and PostgreSQL types::Span is string but public.things.span is interval%0A%0Ainterval maps to orm.Interval%0A%0AFix: declare the field as orm.Interval
::error file=domain/entities.go,line=43,col=2,title=E006 incompatible Go and PostgreSQL types::Quota is orm.Range[int64] but public.things.quota is int4range%0A%0Aint4range maps to orm.Range[int32]%0A%0AFix: declare the field as orm.Range[int32]
::error file=domain/entities.go,line=45,col=2,title=E012 unsupported PostgreSQL type::public.things.price has the unsupported type numrange%0A%0Anumrange ranges over numeric, and numeric has no configured Go mapping: there is no lossless built-in Go type for an arbitrary-precision decimal, and mapping it to float64 would silently corrupt money. Add a types.numeric entry to orm.yaml naming a Go type such as github.com/shopspring/decimal.Decimal%0A%0AFix: exclude the field with orm:"-", change the column's type, or configure a mapping for the element type under types in orm.yaml
::error file=domain/entities.go,line=47,col=2,title=E006 incompatible Go and PostgreSQL types::Slots is orm.Multirange[int64] but public.things.slots is int4multirange%0A%0Aint4multirange maps to orm.Multirange[int32]%0A%0AFix: declare the field as orm.Multirange[int32]
::error file=domain/entities.go,line=51,col=2,title=E006 incompatible Go and PostgreSQL types::Window is Period but public.things.window_ is tstzrange%0A%0Atstzrange maps to orm.Range[time.Time]%0A%0AFix: declare the field as orm.Range[time.Time]
::error file=domain/entities.go,line=52,col=2,title=E012 unsupported PostgreSQL type::public.things.grid is a 2-dimensional array%0A%0Av1 maps one-dimensional arrays only; a Go slice of slices does not round-trip through PostgreSQL's nested array representation%0A%0AFix: store the value as a one-dimensional array, as jsonb, or exclude the field with orm:"-"
